WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:07.600
SCP-682 Vs SCP-049. The Hard to Destroy Reptile&nbsp;
is certainly a pretty pestilent creature,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.680
but would the mild-mannered Plague Doctor&nbsp;
be able to cure our world of its presence?

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:17.360
SCP-049 slowly approached the creature,&nbsp;
seeming equal parts fascinated and frightened.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:22.640
It murmured, “The disease appears to&nbsp;
not affect only humans…” to itself.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.680
It closed in to get a better&nbsp;
look and tried to grab 682,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.520
but the reptile immediately growled and swiped at&nbsp;
049. The doctor narrowly dodged taking any real&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:37.520
damage, but the experience shook him. He seemed&nbsp;
panicked and a little emotionally disturbed.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:41.840
At his own request, he was escorted back&nbsp;
to his containment chamber. Poor guy.

